ds4 (antirez's ds4.c)
https://github.com/antirez/ds4

  Licensed under the MIT License, whose full text, with ds4's copyright
  lines, follows this entry.

  lily serves GLM 5.3 Flash from ds4's published GGUF and follows ds4's
  implementation of the model: the graph (src/glm53/), the GGUF block
  formats and their value formulas including the IQ2_XXS grid and sign
  tables (src/gguf.rs, src/kernels/vulkan/glm53_quant.glsl,
  glm53_iq2xxs_grid.glsl), and these kernels in
  src/kernels/vulkan/glm53.comp, ported from ds4's Metal sources:

    glm53_kda_decode, glm53_kda_prefill_prepare / _recurrence / _output
      metal/glm53_kda.metal (from the kimi-k3 branch)
    glm53_indexer_pool_update
      metal/dsv4_misc.metal, kernel_glm53_indexer_pool_update
    the Sinkhorn split of glm53_hc_pre / glm53_hc_pre2
      ds4.c, hc_split_sinkhorn_one

  tools/reference/glm53/gguf_dequant_golden.c computes its golden values
  with ds4's formulas and quantizer (gguf-tools/quants.c).

